name: cgi-fcgi
description: Missing application pathname Missing -connect <connName> where <connName> is either the pathname of a UNIX domain socket or (if -bind is given) a hostName:portNumber specification or (if -start is given) a :portNumber specification (uses local host).
usage:
- '    cgi-fcgi -f <cmdPath> , or'
- '    cgi-fcgi -connect <connName> <appPath> [<nServers>] , or'
- '    cgi-fcgi -start -connect <connName> <appPath> [<nServers>] , or'
- '    cgi-fcgi -bind -connect <connName> ,'
